#: of q2m3:1
msgid "Hybrid quantum-classical chemistry framework."
msgstr "量电混合量子化学框架。"

#: of q2m3:3
msgid ""
"q2m3 provides QPE, QM/MM solvation, resource-estimation, and optional sample-based quantum "
"diagonalization workflows."
msgstr "q2m3 提供 QPE、QM/MM 溶剂化、资源估计和可选的基于采样的量子对角化工作流。"

