#: ../../source/api-reference/package.rst:23
msgid "Optional SQD Exports"
msgstr "可选 SQD 导出项"

#: ../../source/api-reference/package.rst:25
msgid ""
"q2m3 loads ``q2m3.run_sqd`` on access. This export appears in ``q2m3.__all__`` only when Python "
"can locate both SQD backend modules. The integral entry point and typed contracts live under "
":mod:`q2m3.sqd`. See :doc:`sqd`."
msgstr ""
"q2m3 在访问时加载 ``q2m3.run_sqd``。仅当 Python 能找到两个 SQD 后端模块时，``q2m3.__all__`` 才包含此导出。积分入口和类型契约位于 "
":mod:`q2m3.sqd`。参见 :doc:`sqd`。"

#: ../../source/api-reference/package.rst:31
msgid "Constants"
msgstr "常量"

#: of q2m3.constants:1
msgid "Centralized physical constants for quantum chemistry and QM/MM simulations."
msgstr "量子化学与 QM/MM 模拟共用的物理常量。"

#: of q2m3.constants:3
msgid ""
"All values are Python floats (NOT JAX scalars) for compatibility with both pure Python and @qjit "
"compiled code."
msgstr "所有值均为 Python 浮点数（不是 JAX 标量），以兼容纯 Python 和 @qjit 编译代码。"

#: ../../source/api-reference/package.rst:37
msgid "Molecule Configuration"
msgstr "分子配置"

#: of q2m3.molecule:1
msgid "Molecular system configuration."
msgstr "分子系统配置。"

#: of q2m3.molecule:3
msgid ""
"Provides a generic MoleculeConfig dataclass for configuring QM region parameters in hybrid "
"quantum-classical simulations."
msgstr "提供通用 MoleculeConfig 数据类，用于配置量电混合模拟中的 QM 区域参数。"

#: of q2m3.molecule.MoleculeConfig:1
msgid "Generic molecular system configuration."
msgstr "通用分子系统配置。"

#: of q2m3.molecule.MoleculeConfig:3
msgid ""
"This class supports any molecular system by specifying atomic symbols, coordinates, charge, and "
"active space parameters."
msgstr "通过指定原子符号、坐标、电荷和活性空间参数，此类可支持任意分子系统。"

